                        "review": "[h1] I'll give you 2 reason not to buy this game. [/h1] \r\n\r\n [hr][/hr] \r\n\r\n\r\n[h3] 1 [/h3] \r\n\r\nIt's not really free.\r\nLook at the DLC's\r\nGame used to cost money, I even got the supporter pack then.\r\nthose were like the obligatory skin stuff u get when game launches,\r\nthey are now selling dlc's for double the amount of what the game cost.\r\nused to cost 20 $\r\nand these dlc's give Ubisoft store vibes.\r\n\r\n\r\n[h3] 2 [/h3] \r\n\r\nMount and blade 2\r\nand Kingsmaker is coming out soon.\r\n\r\n\r\n-\r\nYou want me to change this review?\r\nTough love, I bought your game, you took it away from me, consider us even.",
