                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Hello,\n\nThank you for sharing your thoughts, especially as someone who previously purchased Gloria Victis and supported the game through its Supporter Pack.\n\nWe understand why the original shutdown was disappointing, particularly for players who invested both time and money into the game. We also recognize that returning as a free-to-play title doesn't automatically resolve those feelings.\n\nWe'd like to clarify that Gloria Victis is free-to-play, and purchasing DLC packs is not required to access and enjoy the game. However, we understand your concerns regarding the pricing and perceived value of these optional purchases, especially when compared to what you originally paid for the game.\n\nWe respect your decision to share your experience through your review, and we're not here to ask you to change it.\n\nThank you for supporting Gloria Victis in the past and for taking the time to explain your concerns.",
